// "Cellular metabolism" beyond these is labelled: respiration is A-level 3.3, so it appears only as "(supporting)"; heart
// rate control (SAN, AVN, 3.4.8) and heart disease (3.2.7) are cross-references only. Tissue fluid uses the expected AS
